## Common Coaching Conversations

### Scenario 1

Team consistently misses Sprint Goals.

Coaching Approach:

* Review Sprint Planning quality
* Analyze dependencies
* Examine backlog readiness
* Evaluate team capacity

---

### Scenario 2

Product Owner unavailable.

Coaching Approach:

* Clarify responsibilities
* Establish backlog refinement cadence
* Improve stakeholder engagement

---

### Scenario 3

Retrospectives produce no action.

Coaching Approach:

* Focus on one improvement at a time
* Track action ownership
* Review previous commitments

---

## Metrics That Matter

Avoid:

* Number of Story Points completed

Focus on:

* Sprint Goal Achievement
* Predictability
* Cycle Time
* Lead Time
* Defect Leakage
* Customer Value Delivered

